{"id":"5e06493e65d65a44ef81fc78385c62061c983f2c","url":"https://www.businessinsider.com/saturday-night-live-snl-ai-startup-culture-tech-comedy-2026-11","title":"'SNL' goes after AI, startup culture, and 'predatory tech guys'","site_name":"Buzzing","source":"www.businessinsider.com","byline":"Truman Dickerson","excerpt":"'SNL' fired shots at AI startup culture in its latest episode.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><section data-content-container=\"\" role=\"main\">\n\n    \n      \n    \n      <div data-load-strategy=\"disable-lazy\" data-component-type=\"post-top\" data-e2e-name=\"post-top\">\n    \n            \n            \n          \n            \n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-byline\" data-component-type=\"post-byline\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-byline\">\n                        <p><span>By</span>\n                                \n                                \n                                \n                                  <span data-e2e-name=\"Truman Dickerson\">\n                                \n                                    <span>\n                                      <a data-e2e-name=\"byline-author-name\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/author/truman-dickerson\">Truman Dickerson</a>        \n                                  <span data-disable-for-sooth-user=\"\" data-component-type=\"follow-button\" data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" role=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip-position=\"middle\" data-tooltip-active=\"false\" data-state=\"\" data-topic-type=\"author\" data-topic-slug=\"truman-dickerson\" data-topic-link=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/author/truman-dickerson\" data-topic-label=\"Truman Dickerson\" data-topic-location=\"byline\" data-topic-shortened-label=\"Truman\" data-topic-image=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;6a7252cb3f00ff875d13cb15&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Truman Dickerson's picture&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1206,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Truman Dickerson&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1206},&quot;links&quot;:{&quot;self&quot;:&quot;https://i.insider.com/6a7252cb3f00ff875d13cb15&quot;}}\">\n                                    \n                                  \n                                    <div>\n                                      <p>\n                                          You're currently following this author!\n                                   Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.\n                                      </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    \n                                  </span>\n                                    </span>\n                                  </span>  </p>\n                      </div>\n        </div>\n\n  <section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <section id=\"post-body\" data-component-type=\"post-body\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-lock-content=\"\">\n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-hero\" data-component-type=\"post-hero\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\">\n                    <figure data-type=\"img\" data-e2e-name=\"image-figure-image\" data-media-container=\"image\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n                        <div>\n                          <meta itemprop=\"contentUrl\" content=\"https://i.insider.com/6ae767bf8bd5d6547af34792?width=1200\">\n                          <p><img src=\"https://i.insider.com/6ae767bf8bd5d6547af34792?width=700\" srcset=\"https://i.insider.com/6ae767bf8bd5d6547af34792?width=400&format=jpeg&auto=webp 400w, https://i.insider.com/6ae767bf8bd5d6547af34792?width=500&format=jpeg&auto=webp 500w, https://i.insider.com/6ae767bf8bd5d6547af34792?width=700&format=jpeg&auto=webp 700w, https://i.insider.com/6ae767bf8bd5d6547af34792?width=1000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1000w, https://i.insider.com/6ae767bf8bd5d6547af34792?width=1300&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1300w, https://i.insider.com/6ae767bf8bd5d6547af34792?width=2000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 2000w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 900px\" alt=\"SATURDAY NIGHT LIVE -- Episode 1907 - Pictured: (l-r) Anchors Colin Jost and Michael Che during Weekend Update on Saturday, October 10, 2026 -- (Photo by: Will Heath/NBC via Getty Images)\" decoding=\"sync\">\n                        </p></div>\n                    \n                          <span>\n                              <span>\n                                \n                                <label for=\"caption-drawer-btn\">\n                                          </label>\n                        \n                            <figcaption data-e2e-name=\"image-caption\">\n                              <span>'Saturday Night Live' took aim at startup culture and AI across multiple sketches during its Halloween broadcast.</span>\n                              <span>\n                                <span data-e2e-name=\"image-source\" itemprop=\"creditText\">: Will Heath/NBC via Getty Images</span>      </span>\n                            </figcaption>\n                          </span>\n                        </span>\n                        \n                    </figure>\n              </div>\n    \n    \n    \n          \n    \n            \n    \n    \n          \n    \n            \n            \n            \n            \n    \n          \n    \n      <section data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" data-component-type=\"image-modal\" data-track-content=\"\" data-post-type=\"story\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-body-content\">\n                \n                    <p><a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/snl-skit-mocks-dario-amodei-ai-doomsday-predictions-2026-9\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">\"Saturday Night Live\"</a> took aim at startup culture and AI across multiple sketches in its Halloween broadcast, including a spoof of the stereotypical big-talking startup dude, channeled through Stephen King's Pennywise.</p><p>\"We started a company — it's called WeAllFloat.ai,\" comedian Ben Marshall, playing the malevolent clown, said in the segment. \"Instead of trapping one kid with one balloon, what if you had hundreds of AI agents, each with their own digital balloons?\"</p><p>Before Pennywise came on, \"Weekend Update\" host Michael Che got a joke in about the <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/google-share-price-stock-plummet-earnings-ai-search-revenue-2026-10\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">floundering stock price</a> of Google's parent company, Alphabet.</p><p>\"Today's Google Doodle hung itself,\" Che said, referring to the animations Google sometimes uses on its homepage.</p><p>And in another spoof of advertising execs trying to plug a new Sprite flavor on a Latin telenovela, a Sprite rep admits the drink tastes bad because \"we used AI to make it.\"</p><p>\"For the first time in history, AI screwed up,\" she says sarcastically.</p><p>Though \"SNL\" hasn't shied away from lampooning AI and the buzzy startup culture associated with it before, Saturday's broadcast honed in on the Lone Star State as a place where soulless, profit-driven techies are flocking to start new companies.</p><p>Indeed, since 2020, more than 200 companies have <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/companies-moving-to-texas\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">relocated their headquarters</a> to Texas. Many cite comparatively lax regulatory laws and a business-friendly atmosphere.</p><p>Of course, though, moving down south doesn't guarantee profitability. Pennywise, for instance, might have some trouble getting his AI startup off the ground.</p>\n                  \n                \n                  \n                <p>\"Got a little crew together of cool, like-minded, sober, predatory tech guys,\" Marshall says in the segment. \"I live in a loft in Austin with three other motivated young Christians.\"</p>\n                \n                \n                </section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      </section>\n\n    \n    <!-- Included desktop \"post-aside\" -->    \n\n    \n      \n      <section data-component-type=\"post-bottom\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-bottom\">\n        <section>\n    \n    \n            \n            \n    \n            \n            \n            <section data-component-type=\"read-next\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next\" data-display-size=\"4\" data-post-id=\"6ae750c75b849789888951e0\" data-root-margin=\"250px 0px\" data-track-view=\"{&quot;subscription_experience&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;}\">\n              <h2>Read next</h2>\n            \n              <div data-track-click-shared=\"{&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;,&quot;click_text&quot;:&quot;Read next&quot;}\" data-recommendations-content=\"\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next-list\" data-recommendations-list=\"\">\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    <article data-component-type=\"tout\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-post-id=\"post\">\